        "outsideCopy": "Your information Your privacy matters. This is an interactive preview, not a live financial service. Use sample details and a PIN you don’t use elsewhere. What is saved Setup, your test PIN, sample payments, plans and feedback stay in this browser. Other people using the same browser may see them. Never enter a real Ghana Card number, bank PIN or wallet PIN. What is connected No real bank account is opened. No SMS, identity check or payment provider is connected. QR scanning can use your camera with permission; images are processed on this device. Biometric approval is a demo. Service outcomes are simulated. Remove your saved data Clear this site’s data in your browser to remove this preview’s saved details. Feedback export is optional. Before Lumo goes live Live provider disclosures, account terms, retention periods, legal rights and support contacts must be confirmed before real accounts or money can be used. This notice covers the preview only. Back",
